# Placement CRM — Complete Backend Flow Document

> **Stack**: Node.js + Express v5 + PostgreSQL (Supabase)
> **Auth**: JWT via HttpOnly cookies (college users + students) | .env credentials (sysadmin)
> **Last Updated**: March 10, 2026 — reflects full implemented codebase (188 endpoints across 43 modules)

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```
src/
├── config/
│   ├── constants.js            # All enums, messages, config values (LOG, STATUS, ROLES, VALIDATION, ERROR_MESSAGES, SUCCESS_MESSAGES)
│   ├── db.js                   # PostgreSQL pool — query(), getClient(), getMainPool()
│   ├── env.js                  # Validated environment variables via dotenv
│   ├── logger.js               # Winston logger (file + console)
│   └── rateLimiter.js          # authLimiter (auth routes) + apiLimiter (write routes)
├── middleware/
│   ├── authMiddleware.js       # authenticate (JWT verify) + requireRole(...roles)
│   ├── errorHandler.js         # Global error handler — formats all thrown errors
│   ├── requestLogger.js        # Morgan HTTP logging
│   └── validateRequest.js      # Joi validation → req.validated (stripUnknown, abortEarly: false)
├── routes/
│   ├── index.js                # Route aggregator — mounts /api/sysadmin, /api/college, /api/student
│   ├── sysadmin/               # 1 route file
│   ├── college/                # 21 route files
│   └── student/                # 18 route files
├── controllers/                # HTTP layer — extracts req.validated + req.user, calls service, sends response
│   ├── sysadmin/
│   ├── college/                # 21 controller files
│   └── student/                # 18 controller files
├── services/                   # Business logic + all DB queries
│   ├── sysadmin/               # 1 service file
│   ├── college/                # 21 service files
│   └── student/                # 18 service files
├── validators/                 # Joi schemas — one file per module
│   ├── sysadmin/
│   ├── college/
│   └── student/
├── utils/
│   ├── asyncHandler.js         # Wraps async controllers to forward errors to next()
│   ├── emailHelper.js          # sendEmail() via nodemailer
│   ├── jwtHelper.js            # generateToken(payload, options) + verifyToken(token)
│   ├── pagination.js           # getPagination(filters) → { page, limit, offset }
│   ├── passwordHelper.js       # hashPassword(plain) + comparePassword(plain, hash)
│   └── responseHelper.js       # sendSuccess, sendCreated, sendError, sendPaginated
├── app.js                      # Express app setup (middleware chain, route mounting)
└── server.js                   # HTTP server startup on PORT
```

### Total Endpoints: 168
| Scope | Modules | Endpoints |
|-------|---------|-----------|
| Sysadmin | 1 | 9 |
| College | 21 | 93 |
| Student | 18 | 66 |

