### Notification System

```js
// College sends notifications:
// POST /api/college/notifications       — Single notification to one student
// POST /api/college/notifications/bulk  — Bulk to department/passout_year/all

// Bulk target options: { target_type: 'dept', dept_id, passout_year }
//                      { target_type: 'passout_year', passout_year }
//                      { target_type: 'all' }
// Queries matching students → INSERT one notification row per student

// Notification types: 'new_job', 'status_change', 'offer_received',
//                     'deadline_reminder', 'general', 'training', 'result'

// Student reads notifications:
// GET    /api/student/notifications            — List (paginated, unread-first)
