// PATCH  /api/student/notifications/:id/read   — Mark one as read
// PATCH  /api/student/notifications/read_all   — Mark all as read
```

### Override Request (Job Eligibility Override)

Students who fail eligibility can request a manual override from TPO/admin.

**Student side** (`/api/student` — requires `authenticate`):
```
GET  /api/student/check_override_eligibility/:jobId  — Check if override is possible for this job
POST /api/student/request_job_override/:jobId        — Submit override request + reason (apiLimiter)
GET  /api/student/get_my_override_requests           — List all own override requests across jobs
```

**College side** (`/api/college` — requires `authenticate + requireRole(COLLEGEADMIN, TPO, TPC)`):
```
GET   /api/college/get_job_override_requests/:jobId  — All override requests for a specific job (paginated)
GET   /api/college/get_all_override_requests         — Dashboard: all pending requests across jobs (paginated)
PATCH /api/college/review_override_request/:overrideId — Approve/deny a single request (apiLimiter)
POST  /api/college/bulk_review_overrides             — Bulk approve/deny multiple requests (apiLimiter)
```

```
When an override request is submitted (POST request_job_override):
  → Notification is inserted for all users with role IN ('tpo', 'collegeadmin', 'tpc')
     WHERE college_id = student's college AND user_status = 'active'
```

---

### Student Data Verification Flow

College users can review and approve/reject student-submitted profile data. Any authenticated college user can perform verifications (no `requireRole` restriction).

**Verification status fields** (on `student_experience`, `student_achievements`, `student_certificates`; profile uses `profile_approval_status`):
- `verification_status`: `'pending'` → `'approved'` | `'rejected'`
- `is_verified`: boolean
- `verified_by`: FK to `users.user_id`
- `verified_at`: timestamp

**Endpoints** (`/api/college` — `authenticate + apiLimiter`):

```
GET  /api/college/get_pending_verification_counts  — Dashboard widget: counts of pending items per type
                                                     Returns: { profiles, experiences, achievements, certificates, total }
                                                     (profiles counted via profile_complete=true AND profile_approval_status='pending')

GET  /api/college/get_pending_profiles             — Paginated list of profiles awaiting review
GET  /api/college/get_pending_experiences          — Paginated list of pending experience entries
GET  /api/college/get_pending_achievements         — Paginated list of pending achievement entries
GET  /api/college/get_pending_certificates         — Paginated list of pending certificate entries
     (all paginated list endpoints accept sort/filter query params via pendingListSchema)

PATCH /api/college/verify_student_profile/:studentId    — Approve or reject one profile
PATCH /api/college/verify_experience/:experienceId      — Approve or reject one experience
PATCH /api/college/verify_achievement/:achievementId    — Approve or reject one achievement
PATCH /api/college/verify_certificate/:certificateId    — Approve or reject one certificate
      Body (single): verifyActionSchema → { action: 'approved'|'rejected', rejection_reason? }

PATCH /api/college/bulk_verify_profiles      — Bulk approve/reject multiple profiles
PATCH /api/college/bulk_verify_experiences   — Bulk approve/reject multiple experiences
PATCH /api/college/bulk_verify_achievements  — Bulk approve/reject multiple achievements
PATCH /api/college/bulk_verify_certificates  — Bulk approve/reject multiple certificates
      Body (bulk): bulkVerifySchema → { ids: [...], action: 'approved'|'rejected', rejection_reason? }
```

